{"id":"comienzo","lemma":"comienzo","pos":"noun","rank":1208,"glosses":["beginning"],"ipa":"/koˈmjenθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"comienzos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-comienzo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Éste es sólo el comienzo.","en":"This is just the beginning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582416","words":[{"g":"this one"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Comienzo mañana.","en":"I begin tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/502864","words":[null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Todos los comienzos son difíciles.","en":"All beginnings are difficult.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"difficult","l":"difícil"}]},{"text":"Lo sabía desde el comienzo.","en":"I knew it from the start.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77877","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Es un buen comienzo.","en":"It's a good start.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443726","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null]}]}